  "system": {
    "identifier": "kashu-demonic-instrument-cursed-verse",
    "description": "<p>You play a song through your Shinobi Instrument at the detriment of your foes. While many can hear your song, only one is the true target. Select one creature in range as their psyche is repeatedly attacked. Make 2 ranged Genjutsu (or ninjutsu) attacks against them. On a hit, you deal 2d6 psychic damage and force them to make a Charisma saving throw.</p>\n<p>Success: The target suffers no additional effects.</p>\n<p>Failure: The target gains 1 rank of Disoriented and the next non-d20 based roll they make has a d4 penalty.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Same effects as a failure, but the target gains 2 ranks of Disoriented.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
